    "updated_at": "2026-04-12T13:21:32Z",
    "body": "Listbox base appearance is not yet finalized, right? For listbox auto appearance I would expect \"get an optgroup element's label\" to determine the label. And only the `option` elements for the remainder. We shouldn't render all kinds of random elements there. And the same goes for the dropdown variant auto appearance.\r\n\r\nFor dropdown base appearance I think it's fine if multiple `legend` elements end up rendering.",
